    "catalog:note": "Wall-hung WC, its cistern concealed in the wall; lid open against the wall. bottom 0.15, rim 0.40, seat 0.42. The plan shows the pan only. The pan is a ring that abuts a rear block at its tangent, over a floor disc.",
